# Velora API Gateway base URL.
# Leave empty only when the dashboard is served from the same origin as the gateway.
VITE_API_URL=

# Public Langfuse origin only. Do not put Langfuse API keys in VITE_* values.
# For Vercel, use an authenticated HTTPS reverse-proxy/tunnel URL; the server's
# 127.0.0.1:3030 address is reachable only from the homelab host.
